<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-060" chapter-id="c-jinshu-060-eulogy" source-id="s-jinshu-060-eulogy-ws2413335">
  <p id="c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">贊曰：懷惠不競，戚籓力爭。狙詐參謀，憑凶亂政。為惡不已，並羅非命。解繆忠肅，無聞余慶。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0043" ref="pss_n95_7x4">湣皇</persName>纂戎，實賴群公。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0053" ref="emm_pbx_36w">鼎</persName>圖福始，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0058" ref="u3p_4ou_4st">綝</persName>遂凶終。</p>
</text>
